  "description": "Yujeong has a “hot” constitution—so during sex she overheats, and it’s never quite as satisfying as she wants. Eventually, it even leads to a breakup with her boyfriend.\nThen one day, at a high school reunion, she runs into her longtime childhood friend, Hanseo. Unlike Yujeong, Hanseo has a “cold” constitution.\n\nA small touch between them sparks a sudden tension… and before they know it, they end up spending the night together.\n\n…But what happens when their temperatures—and their feelings—start to collide?\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/our_temperature)",
